# A Bert Slide the other way: right held as the powerslide starts swings the nose clockwise, so a
# regular rider going forward slides backside (toes leading), crouched with a hand down.
park lab
cmd 0 teleport -20 -12 0.13 90
cmd 9 speed 9
hold right 11..14
hold ollie 10..80
hold slide 12..80
run 300
expect event trickEnd{trick=BS Bert Slide} within 79..82
expect no event bail
